// Ported overlay code: the levels' own class hooks of the carried / sucked mobys: the hooks of a class's `class +0x2c`
// table that are not Veldin's code (or that the overlay matcher paired with a Veldin hook whose state constants differ: it masks
// them), each at its own level's address. Transliterated instruction by instruction from each level's own overlay
// (the translator, tools/codegen/asm2fn.py --level N, spec tools/codegen/asm2fn_specs/carry_hooks_levels.json): thin wrappers of
// the generic carry bodies (carry_hooks_asm.cpp: Veldin's 0x2db8f8 .., the same code on every level) that set the moby's state
// with the level's own numbers. Dispatched by class_hook_call_level (carry_hooks_levels.cpp). Proved against the original
// (ORACLE_LEVEL=2..10: the levels' own hook tables).
